  - resolution / render scale
  - thermal state
  - power mode
  - test scene / test duration

- frame_metrics:
  - FPS
  - average frame time
  - median frame time
  - P90 / P95 / P99 frame time
  - max frame time
  - jank count
  - frame pacing stability
  - CPU frame time
