  - big / middle / little core usage
  - CPU frequency
  - runnable thread count
  - context switch
  - CPU stall / wait
  - main thread time
  - render thread time
  - worker thread time

- gpu_metrics:
  - GPU utilization
  - GPU frequency
  - GPU busy time
  - vertex / fragment / compute workload
  - shader ALU pressure
  - texture unit pressure
  - bandwidth pressure
  - tiler / binning pressure
  - primitive count
  - draw call count
  - render pass count
  - overdraw signal
  - GPU idle / bubble / wait

- memory_metrics:
  - system memory usage
  - graphics memory usage
