- Frame time
- FPS
- CPU utilization
- CPU frequency
- GPU utilization
- GPU frequency
- GPU busy time
- Memory usage
- Memory bandwidth
- Power
- Temperature
- Process-level CPU / memory
- Main thread / Render thread timing

## 图形应用建议补采

- Draw calls
- Triangles / primitives
- Render passes
- Texture bandwidth
- Fragment workload
- Vertex workload
- Shader ALU
- Texture sampling
- Overdraw signal
- GPU queue timing
